 "text": "9/29/26, 9:48 AM\n\nMessage Types\n\ne CreditAgencyReportERPDebtRecoveryScoreByDebtorPartyQuery\n\nNotes on SAP Implementation\n\nProcessing\n\nYou need to activate the use of the debt recovery score in Customizing of Contract Accounts Receivable and Payable under\nBusiness Transactions -> Submit to Collection Agency -> Define Specifications for Debt Recovery Score.\n\nEnhancements\n\nYou can enhance this service operation by using the event concept in Contract Accounts Receivable and Payable. In event 6252,\nyou can fill customer-specific fields in the outbound message used to request the debt recovery score. These fields are included in\nthe message type using a data type enhancement.\n\nManage Contract Account In\n\nDefinition\n\nRequest to and confirmation from contract account for provision of contract account data.\n\nTechnical Data\n\nEntity Type               Service Interface\nCategory                  SAP A2A\nDirection         inbound\n\nBusiness Context and Use\n\nThe inbound service interface Manage Contract Account In groups operations that read information from the system which is\n\nrelevant for the contract account.\n\nChange Contract Account based Credit Worthiness Change\nInformation\n\nDefinition\n\nTo receive information about a change to a debtor's creditworthiness.\n\nTechnical Data\n",
